@*
	site.js must stay a blocking script in <head>: it applies the stored colour
	theme before first paint. Adding defer/async reintroduces a flash of the
	wrong theme.

	Bootstrap's JS bundle was removed along with Bootstrap itself — the navbar
	toggle and theme flyout are now handled in Scripts/SiteNav.ts and
	Scripts/ThemeSwitchManager.ts.
*@
<script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
